      "username": "DoomBudgie",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/doombudgie/{size}/4906_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-04-15T15:43:30.806Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’ve certainly allowed Intuition as the Power die for a CC attack. As we described it, the character used their Intuition to know where to strike to cause maximal damage. As long as the player can explain in a reasonable way something should work, I think it is reasonable to use any Power/Quality for any action. The narrative creativity is the key point.</p>",
