      "cooked": "<p>Justifications need not be terribly strong…</p>\n<p>Any perceptive power is “seeing an opening to exploit”<br>\nAny environmental can be “forcing them onto your fist”<br>\nIllusions can hide the attack <em>pro forma</em> either by not letting it be seen, or by making it seem there are multiples inbound… only one is real but they don’t know <em>which</em>.</p>",
